rs younger than me but  she's like so stubborn  and she's like so headstrong on monday  jamie lynn took to instagram and wrote  quote  i don't own a condo and i can assure you  that no one has ever bought me  a place at the beach because i prefer my  beach vacations at the ritz  anyways she added quote y'all need to  stop  reaching while jamie lynn denied owning  a condo  she has previously referenced having a  condo  in 2015 jamie lynn replied to a fan's  question on twitter  about her favorite vacation spot she  wrote quote  we have a condo in destin florida and  it's the best getaway  and in 2016 jamie lynn told cmt  news she felt pretty blessed to have the  condo  the new developments follow the free  britney movement gaining a  big supporter over the weekend on sunday  brittany's  longtime agent and friend kade hudson  spoke out against her conservatorship  sharing this  lengthy message to instagram kade wrote  in part  quote this is a violation of someone's  basic human  rights elsewhere in the post kate  explained why he hasn't spoken out until  now  cade said quote i've kept my mouth shut  out of the fear  of losing my job while he doesn't  identify the individual  kate alleges someone who repeatedly  threatened his career  only referring to the person as quote  the man we all know who  and adding quote i won't even dignify  mentioning his name in the comments  cade's message received plenty of  celebrity support  sarah jessica parker andy cohen and  paris hilton  just to name a few and she's just  so sweet and down to earth and really an  amazing woman and i'm just  so proud of her kade also took a moment  to praise britney's new attorney  matthew rosengart calling him quote the  best of the best  and someone who knows the work has just  begun
 

